Falsifies `block_roster_contract::read_is_total_on_a_whole_page_with_any_header`.

The defect: `read` takes the room the page has from the capacity word the writer
left instead of measuring its own mapping. Every check then passes on a header
whose capacity word and count agree, however far past the page they run, and
`read` slices entries the mapping does not hold.

Expected to fail: an out-of-bounds slice index in `read`, on a page whose
header names a capacity and a count of more than 510 entries.


